TimesFM 2.5 (200M) - browser/ONNX conversion

The model weights in model/ are derived from google/timesfm-2.5-200m-pytorch
(https://huggingface.co/google/timesfm-2.5-200m-pytorch), Copyright 2025 Google LLC,
developed by Google Research (https://github.com/google-research/timesfm) and released
under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Paper: Das, Kong, Sen, Zhou. "A decoder-only foundation model for time-series
forecasting." ICML 2024. https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.10688

Modifications: the PyTorch checkpoint was exported to ONNX (opset 17) as a single
fixed-context (512) prefill pass and its MatMul weights were quantized to 8-bit
(onnxruntime MatMulNBits, symmetric, block 32). The JavaScript pre/post-processing
in timesfm.js re-implements the reference forecast() logic from the timesfm package
(Apache-2.0). This is not an official Google product.
